source: crates/hydronode-cli/tests/c3_help.rs
expression: text
---
Devices you manage: firmware, health, battery, signal and running updates.
'update' checks first, shows what would change and asks before it starts.

Usage: hn devices [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list    Devices you manage with firmware, health, battery and signal
  show    Details, error rates and recent jobs of one device
  update  Update firmware or settings over the air

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn devices
  hn devices show <sensor-id>
  hn devices update <sensor-id> --firmware latest
  hn devices update <id> <id> --interval 5m --yes
